WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,750
Right

2
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,120
But the soldiers also have to modify their own mechas to solve this situation.

3
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:08,320
If you don't think of a way to make money, you probably won't be able to use the Kirin-haired prototype mecha by the time you graduate. Then you need it even more.

4
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:09,400
A pair of reliable teammates

5
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:11,360
It's best to be strong, otherwise you can make more money

6
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:12,560
Not enough to pay the maintenance fee

7
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:14,520
It's hard to find teammates

8
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,280
The minimum number of people here to form a team

9
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:18,700
Is there any limit to three?

10
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:19,860
Over 18 years old

11
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:24,380
There's nothing left to do with the rest, right?

12
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:27,060
Wait for your teammates somewhere else

13
00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:32,390
Want this, this, and this

14
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:33,350
Two portions of fried dumplings too

15
00:00:33,350 --> 00:00:34,310
No need to order so much

16
00:00:34,350 --> 00:00:41,300
I just drank the nutrient solution at noon and I'm not hungry yet. Oops, I forgot about you when I went there. I'll treat you to see what you want to eat. You're welcome.

17
00:00:41,420 --> 00:00:42,700
We can talk about things later when we are full.

18
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:45,340
Can you finish eating?

19
00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:48,750
The school cafeteria does not have these things

20
00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:49,990
But if I can’t finish it later,

21
00:00:49,990 --> 00:00:51,030
He must be persuaded to pack
